WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.102
The takeaway: video generation becomes more
controllable when you treat a video as a composition

00:00:06.182 --> 00:00:09.258
of conditions and give motion an explicit signal.

00:00:09.338 --> 00:00:15.440
VideoComposer combines compressed-video motion
vectors with a Spatio-Temporal Condition encoder,

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:20.850
so users steer content and motion together, from
text, sketches, and depth to masks,

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:25.100
reference videos, or two strokes, while keeping
frames consistent.
